[00:14.432]When I was a kid
{"当我还是个孩子"}
[00:16.788]I thought that everybody had it together
{"我以为每个人都过得很好"}
[00:21.638]A swing and a miss
{"挥棒落空"}
[00:23.972]And I'm having trouble keeping my head up
{"我难以抬起头来"}
[00:27.038]I dream too big, but I’m in too deep
{"我梦想太大，却陷得太深"}
[00:30.642]Nights get long when you can’t get sleep
{"无法入睡时，夜晚变得漫长"}
[00:34.138]My heart might break, but it won’t break me
{"我的心也许会碎，但不会击垮我"}
[00:37.875]Won’t break me
{"不会击垮我"}
[00:42.135]Take me home
{"带我回家"}
[00:44.707]I’m running through the great unknown
{"我正穿越巨大的未知"}
[00:48.249]Nobody tells you where the hell to go
{"没人告诉你究竟该往哪走"}
[00:51.631]It’s a lonely road
{"这是一条孤独的路"}
[00:56.421]Chasing cars
{"追逐着车"}
[00:58.893]I think I’ve gone a mile too far
{"我想我已走得太远"}
[01:02.469]I’m dying to get back to the start
{"我渴望回到起点"}
[01:05.789]But I’m falling apart
{"但我正在崩溃"}
