[01:25.642]If I have a son
{"如果我有个儿子"}
[01:27.838]I’d tell him everything that my father didn’t
{"我会告诉他我父亲没告诉我的一切"}
[01:32.429]Maybe that’s why I run
{"也许这就是我奔跑的原因"}
[01:34.947]Instead of holding all the cards that I’m given
{"而不是紧握手中所有的牌"}
[01:37.930]I love too hard and I fall too fast
{"爱得太用力　也陷得太快"}
[01:41.639]The years slipped by, gave it all I have
{"岁月悄然流逝　我已倾尽所有"}
